  "updated_at": "2026-03-22",
  "bio": "Krusty Cola is a tattoo artist renowned for their exceptional skill in creating organic abstract tattoos with a distinct 'dotwork' technique that brings a unique texture and depth to their designs. Proving to be an expert in their field, Krusty combines intricate precision with artful expression to craft each piece in their cozy Elsene, Belgium studio. Clients leave not only with a striking tattoo but also with an appreciation for Krusty's dedication to both their craft and cleanliness, ensuring that every session is conducted in a hygienic and spotless environment.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Elsene, Brussels, Belgium"
